# Playwright artefacts. Committed BEFORE the artefacts can appear, so a CI run
# that writes a report/trace here never offers them to `git add -A`.
#
# Note the leading slash: these anchor to tests/e2e/ itself. The visual
# project's committed PNG baselines live in
# tests/e2e/visual/*.spec.ts-snapshots/ and are deliberately NOT matched.
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
/.auth/
